+# QuicUI Engine Patch - Migration Guide
+
+## Applying QuicUI Patch to New Flutter SDK Versions
+
+This guide explains how to apply the QuicUI Code Push engine modifications to newer Flutter SDK releases.
+
+## Quick Start
+
+### Option 1: Cherry-pick (Recommended)
+
+```bash
+# Clone the official Flutter SDK
+git clone https://github.com/flutter/flutter.git flutter-quicui
+cd flutter-quicui
+
+# Checkout the desired Flutter version
+git checkout 3.27.0  # or any stable/beta/master
+
+# Add QuicUI fork as remote
+git remote add quicui git@github.com:Ikolvi/QuicUIFlutterSDK.git
+git fetch quicui
+
+# Cherry-pick the QuicUI modifications
+git cherry-pick quicui-v1.0.0-engine
+
+# If conflicts occur, see "Resolving Conflicts" section below
+```
+
+### Option 2: Manual Patch Application
+
+```bash
+# Download the patch file
+curl -L https://github.com/Ikolvi/QuicUIFlutterSDK/commit/9fcb574f34e.patch > quicui.patch
+
+# Apply the patch
+git apply quicui.patch
+
+# If it fails with conflicts, use:
+git apply --3way quicui.patch
+```
+
+## Files Modified by QuicUI Patch
+
+### New Files (Add these)
+```
+engine/src/flutter/shell/common/codepush_loader.h
+engine/src/flutter/shell/common/codepush_loader.cc
+engine/src/flutter/shell/platform/android/io/flutter/embedding/engine/loader/QuicUICodePushLoader.java
+```
+
+### Modified Files (Merge changes)
+```
+engine/src/flutter/shell/platform/android/io/flutter/embedding/engine/loader/FlutterLoader.java
+```
+
+## Resolving Merge Conflicts
+
+### Common Conflict: FlutterLoader.java
+
+If `FlutterLoader.java` has conflicts, manually apply these changes:
+
+1. **Add import at the top:**
+```java
+import io.flutter.embedding.engine.loader.QuicUICodePushLoader;
+```
+
+2. **Add method before `ensureInitializationComplete()`:**
+```java
+/**
+ * Check for QuicUI code push patches before Flutter initialization
+ */
+private void checkForQuicUIPatch() {
+  if (shellArgs.containsKey(FlutterLoader.AOT_SHARED_LIBRARY_NAME)) {
+    return; // Already set
+  }
+  
+  String arch = android.os.Build.SUPPORTED_ABIS[0];
+  String patchedPath = QuicUICodePushLoader.getPatchedAOTPath(
+    applicationContext, 
+    arch
+  );
+  
+  if (patchedPath != null) {
+    shellArgs.put(FlutterLoader.AOT_SHARED_LIBRARY_NAME, patchedPath);
+  }
+}
+```
+
+3. **Call it in initialization method (find the initialization logic):**
+```java
+// Add this line before ensureInitializationCompleteAsync() returns
+checkForQuicUIPatch();
+```
+
+### Testing Conflict Resolution
+
+After resolving conflicts:
+
+1. **Verify compilation:**
+```bash
+cd engine/src
+./flutter/tools/gn --android
+ninja -C out/android_debug_unopt
+```
+
+2. **Run tests:**
+```bash
+cd flutter
+flutter test
+```
+
+3. **Build test app:**
+```bash
+cd test_apps/quicui_test_app_v1
+flutter build apk
+```
+
+## Verifying the Patch
+
+### 1. Check Files Exist
+```bash
+# New C++ files
+ls engine/src/flutter/shell/common/codepush_loader.*
+
+# New Java file
+ls engine/src/flutter/shell/platform/android/io/flutter/embedding/engine/loader/QuicUICodePushLoader.java
+
+# Modified Java file
+git diff HEAD~1 engine/src/flutter/shell/platform/android/io/flutter/embedding/engine/loader/FlutterLoader.java
+```
+
+### 2. Verify Code Push Functionality
+```bash
+# Build with patched engine
+flutter build apk --release
+
+# Install on device
+adb install build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-release.apk
+
+# Check for code push capability
+adb shell run-as com.your.app ls /data/data/com.your.app/code_cache/
+# Should see quicui_patches directory (after first patch install)
+```
+
+### 3. Test Platform Channel
+```dart
+// In your Dart code
+import 'package:quicui_code_push_client/quicui_code_push_client.dart';
+
+final hasCodePush = await CodePushMethodChannel.hasPatch();
+print('Code Push available: $hasCodePush');
+```
+
+## Version Compatibility
+
+| QuicUI Version | Base Flutter Version | Tested Flutter Versions |
+|----------------|---------------------|------------------------|
+| v1.0.0-engine  | 3.24.x              | 3.24.0 - 3.27.0       |
+
+## Maintenance Strategy
+
+### When to Update
+
+Update the QuicUI patch when:
+1. New Flutter stable release
+2. Breaking changes in Flutter engine
+3. Security updates in Flutter core
+
+### Update Process
+
+```bash
+# On QuicUI fork
+git checkout quicui/main
+git fetch origin
+git rebase origin/stable  # or origin/master for latest
+
+# Resolve conflicts
+# Test thoroughly
+# Create new tag
+git tag -a quicui-v1.1.0-engine -m "Updated for Flutter 3.28.0"
+git push quicui quicui/main quicui-v1.1.0-engine
+```
+
+## Architecture Overview
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Dart Application                        │
+│  - QuicUICodePush.downloadAndInstall()  │
+│  - Platform channel communication        │
+└───────────────┬─────────────────────────┘
+                │ dev.quicui.code_push
+                ↓
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Android Platform (Java)                 │
+│  - QuicUICodePushLoader                  │
+│  - CodePushMethodHandler                 │
+│  - FlutterLoader (startup check)         │
+└───────────────┬─────────────────────────┘
+                │ JNI / File System
+                ↓
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Flutter Engine (C++)                    │
+│  - codepush_loader.h/cc                  │
+│  - AOT snapshot loading                  │
+└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+## Patch Contents Summary
+
+### C++ Engine Core
+- **codepush_loader.h**: Interface for code push functionality
+- **codepush_loader.cc**: Implementation with validation logic
+
+### Android Platform
+- **QuicUICodePushLoader.java**: Manages patch files in code cache
+  - `getPatchedAOTPath()`: Returns path to patched snapshot
+  - `hasPatch()`: Check if patch exists
+  - `clearPatch()`: Rollback to original
+  - Hash validation on every load
+
+- **FlutterLoader.java**: Integration point
+  - `checkForQuicUIPatch()`: Called during app startup
+  - Adds `--aot-shared-library-name` flag if patch exists
+  - Auto-fallback on corruption
+
+## Troubleshooting
+
+### Build Errors
+
+**Error: Cannot find symbol QuicUICodePushLoader**
+```bash
+# Ensure file exists
+ls engine/src/flutter/shell/platform/android/io/flutter/embedding/engine/loader/QuicUICodePushLoader.java
+
+# Clean and rebuild
+flutter clean
+flutter pub get
+flutter build apk
+```
+
+**Error: Duplicate class codepush_loader**
+```bash
+# Check for duplicate files
+find engine/src -name "*codepush*"
+
+# Remove old files if any exist in wrong location
+```
+
+### Runtime Errors
+
+**Platform channel not found**
+```dart
+// Ensure plugin is registered in pubspec.yaml
+flutter:
+  plugin:
+    platforms:
+      android:
+        package: com.quicui.codepush
+        pluginClass: QuicuiCodePushClientPlugin
+```
+
+**Patch not loading**
+```bash
+# Check patch exists
+adb shell run-as com.your.app ls -la /data/data/com.your.app/code_cache/quicui_patches/
+
+# Check FlutterLoader logs
+adb logcat | grep QuicUI
+
+# Verify hash in metadata
+adb shell run-as com.your.app cat /data/data/com.your.app/code_cache/quicui_patches/patch_metadata.json
+```
+
+## Support
+
+- GitHub Issues: https://github.com/Ikolvi/QuicUICodepush/issues
+- Fork Repository: https://github.com/Ikolvi/QuicUIFlutterSDK
+- Main Repository: https://github.com/Ikolvi/QuicUICodepush
+
